@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@uniqueId = {{$guid}}

### Health check: works even when the database is not configured
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Successful tenant signup: requires PlatformDatabase to be configured
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName": "Manual Test Tenant",
  "tenantKey": "manual-{{uniqueId}}",
  "adminName": "Manual Test Admin",
  "adminEmail": "manual-{{uniqueId}}@example.com",
  "password": "manual-test-password-123"
}

### Validation error: expected HTTP 400 (password is shorter than 12 characters)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName": "Invalid Test Tenant",
  "tenantKey": "invalid-{{uniqueId}}",
  "adminName": "Manual Test Admin",
  "adminEmail": "invalid-{{uniqueId}}@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}
